  <para style="h">Agalatiyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Agalatiyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Agalatiyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Agalatiyi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Bwulus, tnutnuloyi; aza nu to ɓə tnu mi tnutnu kwo ge zanyikwoci ho m, ama Yeisu Kirisiti nu ɓə tnu mi, ǹ Shekwoyi Dadai ń wo ɓə lá Yeisu kala n əfyi nyi. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Ɓədo n əmi azajei vnyanya, azanugbai n anyikwozai n ɓa kwnusnu lo n əmii nyi.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="GAL 1:2">Kwoi lo da aikilisiya n ɓa fyi ń Galatiya nyi.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa ɓe da fye, n ɓa kwnu n Shekwoyi əyi Dada aba ɓədo n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />N wo ɓə ga əwohni tukwo ntu əyi aleifyi ɓo ntuge wa gnyi yi ya ń cala nukwoi ye kwoi vyi Shekwoyi əyi Dada ɓəye. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Latu zhni əwo nya nu nyalonyalo. Amyi.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nabagyi manai ədo to shnasnu lo m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ce wo mi lo shi fye pye n avnu pmyiwu n əza aba n wo ɓə yi fye nge fya gyianyì fyi n Kirisiti shebmyashi, ama fyei pmyiawye wulo nabagyi manai ədo nu gbowo, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />ɓəhnihnii kwo to zhni nabagyi manai nu m, kpeekpe. Kwo wulo pəipəi nge azaho nu fyi fye ń ajegbmi jesnu ɓai zhni she ɓa ɓá myi nabai ɓaa Kirisiti nabagyi manai pmyibma. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ama kwo əyi kwo maləka n wa gbmiɓe ń əshemi waa zhni waazi nabagyi manai ədo nya, gbowo n ədoi ń yi ɓə zhni nyi, Shekwoyi knyitu ɓa vyi wo! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ngye shi yi kwu shnida nyi, ntulonu nsaiye mi je da: Ngye əzaho zhni fye waazi ədo lo gbowo n ədoi ń fye ɓə gwo nyi, Shekwoyi knyitu kwo la tu ń wo tukwo!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Mi gnyi nsaiye mii ye azanyikwoci nu ɓa da mi əɓo manai kwo Shekwoyi a? Kwo mi ye əmi ɓo kwa da aza nu a? Ngye mi ye gnyi mii ye əmi əɓo nu kwa da aza, to mi ye zhni Kirisiti tnutnuyi nu m.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi nu ɓə yi Bwulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mi ncei pmalo fya kpe, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, nge nabagyi manai waazi n mi ɓə zhni nyi əkwo əɓo ta pá n zanyikwoci aba nu m. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Mi to ɓə gwo kwo n zanyikwoci akwnu nu kwo nge a ɓə wu mi kwo wuwu m; ama mi ɓə gwo kwo dna n ɓəwyegye nu n Yeisu Kirisiti akwnu.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ntuge fye kwu əmi anyìgyi saapa nya ɓo wo dna n Ayahudiyi kwnunu, ngye shi mi ɓə wu ikilisiya Shekwoyi nya awyesnugbegye ɓo n əwyei bmyibmyi, jesnu ma zhni shi mi ɓa myi ma zhni kwo agbma. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Mi ɓə dna mii mwa dna n Ayahudiyi kwnunu n du əmi ashala bəgyé jesnu n əwyei nyinyíi dəidəi ntu əmi azakwoyi kwnunu ɓo. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ama she kwo ɓə bmya Shekwoyi wa knyi mi dna ń əmi əya nubwo, wa yì mi dna n əwo shebmyashi, kwa bmya wo <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />waa əwo nugwnu kpeyawu dna ń mi nabai n mi ɓa zhni wo waazi dna n Abyedo aba, əmi əɓo pitala kpmisnui əkwo nu ge mi to ɓəlo ma sa n zanyikwoci dəhodəhoi m. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Mi to ɓə gwnulo Urishelima ntuge mi gye aza yi n ɓa ɓə zhni atnutnuloyi n əmi abye nyi m, ama ma lo Arabyiya. N əkwo avnu ma jezeɓe Damaskwos.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Nlonu n aye ngwnu-ata avnu, ma gwnulo Urishelima ntuge mii gye Kefas ma kpe wo ye; maa kwnudna n woi anyipyei awoceatnu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Mi to ɓə gye atnutnuloyi aje əwye m, akpəge Jemyis, Dagayi mado. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Mi myi fye abwugba zhi n Shekwoyi abye, nge ənya n mi ka ga fye nyi akatá nu to m.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Nlonu ma lo Siriya n Kilikiyai. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Aikilisiya Yahudiya nya n ɓa fyi n Kirisiti nyi ɓa to ɓə zhni ɓai kpe əmi əye m. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ɓa ɓə ɓwa nabagyi nu wo: “Əza n wo ɓə zhni woi wu yi awyesnugbegye ɓo nyi, wo laɓa lo woi zhni waazi gaiciyaga nya, ń wo ɓə ye wa zhni kwo agbma nyi.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Jesnu ɓa ci Shekwoyi ntu əmi ɓo.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Atnutnuloyi ɓa la Bwulus gwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Nlonu n aye awoceanyi avnu, ma jezelo Urishelima n kwnusnu n Banabai. Mi ɓə la Titusu la lo ncei ɓədo. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Mi ɓə vyi ɓəwyegye apita nu jesnu, ma sase fyaa n aza yi n ɓa zhni atukwoda n a ga ɓa mwamwa nyi. Ma wu ɓa waazi nabagyi manai nya n mi ɓə zhni ga Abyedo nyi. Mi ɓə ncei pma ma kwu kpe nge mi to ɓə gnyi mii znazna kwo ge mi kwu znazna ya dna n anyìgyi gbəloi m. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Dudulonu kwo Titusu n wo ɓə kwnusnu n mii nyi, a to ɓə yekwofyi wo nu nge wo znunya m, kwo shikwonyi wo ɓə zhni Girik nu. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Əɓəye ɓə laka gnyi ntuge agaiciyagayi akwocednayi ɓə kwu lofyi nu n əyi atasni; ɓai pmi yi gye fyaa, əyi loloya n yi ncei lo dna n Kirisiti Yeisu nyi, ɓai ye ɓa kwu yi zhni afyenu. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Yi to ɓə ga ɓa aba kwo fyewyi m, nabai ń a ɓa myi a kwu nabagyi manai gaiciyanunui wnaknazhi ga əfye.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ama aza yi n a ɓə n ɓai ga mwamwa yaakwo nyi; kwo ɓa ɓə zhni anyika nu a, kwo to ɓə shnado n əmi aba m; Shekwoyii ta knyi aza knyiknyi nu n wo ɓa wu ɓa əwo bmyashi m; ɓa to ɓə ɓe mi nyaho ń əmi waazizhni m. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />N əkwoɓwi, ɓa ɓə kwu kpe nge a la tnutnu waazizhni nabagyi manai nya fnyi mi əɓwa ntu atnanyaznuyi ɓo, n ɓwasnu shi a ɓə ncei ga Byitusu tnutnuloyi ntu anyaznuyi ɓo nyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Ntuge Shekwoyi, n əwo nu ɓə zhni apma n Byitusui n zhni tnutnuloyi n anyaznuyi aba nyi, əwo nu ɓə ɓwa je dna n mi woi zhniapma n mii ngye tnutnuloyi ga Abyedo. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Jemyis, Kefas n Yohanai; aza yi n ɓa nu ɓə zhni azhigwo nyi, ɓa ɓə la mi gwo n Banabai dna n jedoɓəzhni manai, əsa n ɓa ɓə gye shebmyashi ń a la ga mi nyi. Ɓa kwu ye nge yi lo da Abyedo n kasnu əɓa ɓa lo da anyaznuyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Əɓo vnyanya n ɓa ɓə ye nge ya gwodu n zhnii əkwo nu nge yi pa awyekwoyi ɓo; əɓo nu nyi n mi ɓə shni fafashi ge ma zhni.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus gnyiapaapa n Kefasii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Əsa n Kefas ɓə ɓe Antiyok nyi, ma gnyiapaapa n woi gnyi n əwo awye ntu əɓo ɓo n wo ɓə zhni nyi, kwaa zè nge wo ɓə la əwohni znuknyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Ntuge azaho, n ɓa ɓə kwnu n Jemyis aba, ɓa ɓə snu nabai n ɓa ɓe əwo aba nyi, wo ɓə zhni wa kwnu nyagyi gyi n Abyedoyii. Ama she ɓa ɓə kwu si, wa ya woi ta n avnui woi kpe əwohni ya n Abyedo, ntuge wo ɓə wó aza yi ədna n ɓa ɓə fyi n nyaznu okwu nyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ayahudiyi aje ɓa kwu vyi əwo kwocedna, kwaa zè nge n əɓa kwocedna, kwo Banaba wo ɓə la ɓwuaba ce.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />She mi ɓə gye nge ɓa ta zhni əɓo lo vyi gaiciyanunui nabagyi manai nya m, ma gna Kefas n əɓa awye vnyanya, “Ho zhni Yahudiyi nu, dudulonu hoi gyianyì ngye Abyedo, toge ngye Yahudiyi m. Kwo zè n wunanu hoi n Abyedoi gyice nge ɓa vyi Ayahudiyi kwnunu a?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />“Əyi ń a ɓə ma yi n zhni Ayahudiyi nyi, ama toge Abyedo aleifyizhniyi m, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />yi kpəlo nge əza ta ɓwa ɓogyikpmaya ntu owa ɓwashi ɓo nu m, ama n gaiciyagai nu dna n Yeisu Kirisiti. Ntulonu, əyihni ce, yi kwu gaiciyaga dna n Kirisiti Yeisu, nabai n a ɓaa aɓo kpma yi ya n gaiciyagai dna n Kirisiti, toge dna n owa ɓwashi m, ntuge dna n owa ɓwashi, əza to lo n wo ɓa ɓwa ɓəgyikpmaya m.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />“Ama ngye əza zna ɓəgyikpmaya shni lo dna n Kirisiti, əyihni, Ayahudiyi, aa gye yi fyi zhi nsaiye n aleifyizhni nu, kwo to wu nu nge Kirisiti nu gnyi woi wu yi leifyizhni əgbá m? Nlonu to m, kpeekpe. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ndei ń ma je anya mi n mi ɓə la vyiya nyi, ɓəhnihni nu ge mi zhni owa gnanaznuyi nu.<verse eid="GAL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />“Ntuge n owa yekpei nu ń mi ɓə fyí dna n owa, nabai ń mi ɓa myi ma gyianyì ga Shekwoyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />A lá mi znudu n kwnusnu n Kirisitii, əmi nu to ye gyianyì m, ama Kirisiti nu gyianyì dna nsaiye n əmi. Anyìgyi ń mi gyi dna ń nayi nsaiye nyi, mi gyi ɓa dna n gaiciyai ga nu dna n Shekwoyi Nugwnu, əwo n wo ɓə ye mi, wa ga əwohni tukwo ntu əmi ɓo nyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mi taa kna shebmyashi Shekwoyi nya ya ma n gnagna m, ntuge ń a ɓə ɓa ɓwa ɓəfyecezhni dna n owa, a gye Kirisiti əfyi kwo la zè gbəloi nu!”<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gaiciyaga kwo owa atnutnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Əfye Agalatiyi amama! Nyikanu kwu agwuzhenyi wu fye a? N əfye awyeba nu n a ɓə kwu Yeisu Kirisiti wu tu pəipəi ń znuznuidu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Mi ye ma ɓwa əɓo gbmanyi nu kpeye ń əfye aba: Fye ɓə gwo Zafnu n atnutnu owa nyai nu, kwo n gaiciyagai nu ń əɓo n fye ɓə wo nyi a? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Fye kwu zè amama nu nlai? Shi fye ɓə ya znazna fyi n Zafnu, fyei ye fya zo n fyi n nayi nu nsayi? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Əfye azhnìgye n mwa ɓa kwu zè gbəloi nu; ngye ɓa kwu agbəloi nu zhni? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ntulonu mi nyaɓo lo njesnu, Shekwoyi ga fye əwo Zafnu, woi zhni aɓəwowoi fyi n əfye atasni n owa atnutnui nu, kwo n gaiciyagai nu ń əɓo n fye kwu wo nyi a? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Ntulonu ce, Ibrahim “ɓə la gaiciya ga Shekwoyi, jesnu aa kwo ba dna wo ge ɓəfyecezhni.”<verse eid="GAL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Nlonu, fye ɓwa awyega, nge aza yi nu n ɓa n gaiciyagai lo, əɓa nu zhni Ibrahim aɓyi. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Nyakashi ɓə kwu ɓəye pmawyegye nge Shekwoyi ɓə la ɓəgyikpmaya n Abyedo dna n gaiciyaga, jesnu waa nabagyi manai pma əwyidna ga Ibrahim: “Abye vnyanya ɓə ɓwa anabəlika ntu əho ɓo nu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ntulonu aza yi n ɓa kpema gaiciyaga nu ɓa n anabəlikai lo n kwnusnu n Ibrahimii, əza gaiciyagayi.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ntuge aza vnyanya n ɓa kpmima n owa tnutnu nyi, ɓa fyi ń knyitu nu, ngye she kwo kafyilo: “Knyituyi nú n zahozahoyi n wo to gwodu wa zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi n kwo kafyilo n Pafyi Owa nya m.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Kwo wulo pəipəi nge əza to lo n wo kpema n owa, n wo ɓa ɓwa aɓəkpmaya n Shekwoyi aba m, ntuge, “ɓəfyecezhniyi ɓa gyianyì n gaiciyagai nu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />A to n owai mi tu ń gaiciyaga nu m; n əkwoɓwi kwa gna, “əza n wo zhni aɓo ye, wo ɓa gyianyì n ɓai nu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kirisiti ɓə la yi shna ń knyitu owa nya, waa zè knyitu ntu əyi ɓo, ntuge kwo kafyilo: “Zahozahoyi zhni knyituyi nu ń wo gyitu lo n znudu shnuwna.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Wo ɓə shna yi nabai nge anabəlika n a ɓə ga Ibrahim nyi, n ɓa ɓá myi ɓa ɓe da Abyedo dna n Kirisiti Yeisu, nabai ge dna n gaiciyaga nu n yi ɓa gwo ɓəgbeshi Zafnu nya.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owa n ɓəgbeshii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Əmi azaje n amapwuyii, fye fa ma la ɓədogbe she a gyianyì fyegyifyegyi nyi. N ɓwasnu ngye shi əzaho taa myi wa ɓe kwo wa pmyi zanyikwoci ɓəgbeshi ma n gnagna ń a la kwo myishì dna n ofye nyi m, kwo ɓwa wu nlonu nu n ɓəye. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />A ɓə kwu aɓəgbeshi zhi Ibrahim ɓədo n əwo nyabyei. Nyakagyigyiyi to gna “ń anyabyei” nu m, n kwo ɓa gyi nge aza bəgyé m, ama “n əho nyabyei,” n kwo wu nge zaknayi nu, əwo nu zhni Kirisiti. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Əɓo ń mi zhninubwo əkwo nu nyi: owa, ń a ɓə ɓe n kwoi n aye 430 avnu nyi, kwo ta pmyi ɓəgbeshi kwokwoi mà n gnagna ń Shekwoyi ɓə la shni shishi nyi, nabai kwaa ɓəgbeshi la ya m. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ngye əgwú kpema n owa nu, to, a gye kwo to ye kpema n ɓəgbeshinu m; ama Shekwoyi dna n əwo shebmyashi ɓə ga Ibrahim kwo dna n ɓəgbeshinu.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />To knyiyi nu ɓə zhni a shni owa ye gaga a? A ɓə ɓe n kwoi ntu owa gnanaznu ɓo nu kwoi nya əsa n əza Nyabye ń a ɓə shi kwo əgbe nyi woi la ɓe. A ɓə ga owa ń amaləka akwnu nu jesnu aa kwo ga ɓəwnazhiyi wa wna kwo akna. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ama kwo wu nge ɓəwnazhiyi du okwu gbmanyi ya lo; ama Shekwoyi nyi gbmanyi nu.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ntucenu, owa gnyiapaapa lo nu n Shekwoyi ɓəgbeshii? Kwo fyewyi! Ngye owa n a ɓə la ga nyi, kwo ɓə ɓa ga wyewyeyi, akpəge ɓəhnihni ɓəfyecezhni ɓə ɓa ɓe n owai nu. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ama Nyakagyigyiyi n kwu nyahonyahoi gwufyi n leifyi akwnu, nabai ənya n a ɓə shikwo əgbe nyi, n a ga kwo dna n gaiciyaga nu dna n Yeisu Kirisiti nyi, n a ɓa kwu kwo ga aza yi n ɓa ga gaiciya nyi.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi aɓyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Gaiciyaga ye ɓə snu n kwo ɓe, ai kwu yi wnafyi n owa zhalu, n gwufyi nya əsa n a ɓə ye a gbmi gaiciyaga ɓe ncei. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ntulonu owa ɓə zhni əyi zokwowuyi nu nya əsa n Kirisiti ɓə ɓe ya myi ya ɓwa ɓəgyikpmaya dna n gaiciyaga. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Nsaiye she gaiciyaga ye kwo la ɓe nyi, yi to ye shna fyilo n zokwowuyi akwnu nu m.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ntulonu dna n Kirisiti Yeisu əfye vnyanya fye zhni Shekwoyi aɓyi nu dna n gaiciyaga, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />ntuge əfye vnyanya n a ɓə zhni fye batizima fyi n Kirisiti nyi, fye kwu Kirisiti kpe əfyehni. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Yahudiyi to ye shnasnu lo kwo Abyedo, kwo fyenu kwo əza loloiya, kwo a gna nge zanugbayi n nyikwozai m, ntuge əfye vnyanya fye zhni gbmanyi nu dna n Kirisiti Yeisu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ngye n fye zhni Kirisiti anya nu, nlonu a gye fye zhni Ibrahim nyabye nu, jesnu əgwúgyiyi ngye shi ɓəgbeshi lo nyi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Əɓo ń mi gnyi mii da nu nyi, ndei əsa n əgwúgyiyi ye gnyi n zhni əɓyi nu, wo to shnado lo n fyenuyi m, kwo shikwonyi nyaɓwa apyiznutu nya vnyanya kwo zhni əwo nya nu. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Əgwúgyiyi ɓaa dna n azokwowúyi akwnu nu ɓədo n awyeznushiyii nya əsa n əwo dada ncei znutu. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ntulonu ce, əsa n yi to ɓəə kpmiawye m, yi ɓə fyi zhi n fyenu tnutnu nu, fyi n zafnu anyì aɓəfyefyi faafaai. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ama shi əsa n a ɓə ncei shi nyi kwo ɓə la si cimcim, Shekwoyi wa tnu n əwo Nugwnui, nyikwoza wa ma wo. A ma wo dna n owa ɓwashi cala, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />wa shna aza yi n ɓa fyi n owa, nabai n a ɓa gwo ɓa fyi ge anugwnu ashishiyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Ntuge fye zhni əwo anugwnu nu, Shekwoyi ɓə la tnu n əwo Nugwnu Zafnui fyi n əyi adu, Zafnu n wo yi, “Abba, Dada.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ntulonu ho to ye zhni fyenu nu m, ama Shekwoyi əɓyi, shikwonyi ho zhni əwo əɓyi nu nyi, Shekwoyi wo la ho je əgwúgyiyi zè.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus aɓəsa ntu Agalatiyi ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />N sapai, əsa ń fye to ɓəə kpe Shekwoyi əye nyi m, fye ɓə zhni afyenu nu fyi n anya akwnu n ɓa to ɓə zhni ashekwoyi nu m. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ama nsaiye n fye kwu Shekwoyi kpeye nyi; kwo a gna nge Shekwoyi n fyei kpeye lo; kwo zè n wunanu fyei jezelo da anya akalágbai jesnu akwnuyi atnawyekpmiwuyi a? Fye ncei pmalo fya kwu je əɓa afyenu nu zhni njesnu? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Fye n anyipyei tnutnulo fyei ga ɓa mwamwa, n apyai, n asai, n ayei! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Mi dnalo n ədnawo, da əfye ɓo, sakwnú a gye mi la əmihni lúya gbəloi kpe n fye.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mi gyi fye əwye əmi azaje n amapwuyii, fye kwu zè ngye əmi, ntuge mi la əmihni zè ngye əfye. Fye too zhni mi əɓənukwoi m. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ngye shi fye kpəlo nyi, nyasna ɓo nu ɓə zhni ma kpedna ma zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya ga fye, <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />kwo shikwonyi əmi nyasna ɓə zhni mwumwu nu n əfye aba, fye to ɓə shí mi n wyegbacii n aɓəciyayi m. N əkwoɓwi, fya gwo mi ngye mi ɓə zhni Shekwoyi maləka nu, ngye əmi nu ɓə zhni Kirisiti Yeisu n əwohni tukwo. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />To, nsaiye, əmi anabəlika əfye anya zhi ń nanu a? Mi ɓa gbmi fye əɓo, kwo ɓə gna kwo ɓə ɓaa yezhni, fye ɓə ɓaa əfye awyekwnunu kwnu fya kwu ɓa ga mi. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Mi la zè əfye nuwnuyi nu nsayi, ntuge ma gna fye gaiciyanunui?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Aza yi ɓa n əwyei nyinyíi lo nabai ɓa kwu fye wnafyi, ama toge ntu n əɓo manai ɓo m. Ənya n ɓa ye, əkwo nu nge, ɓaa fye kaya n əyi nabai fya ce fya nyiwye ntu əɓa ɓo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Kwo bmyalo əza waa gnyi n əwyei nyinyíi, ndei n əkwo ɓətukwo bmyalo, jesnu əza waa gnyi nlonu nsahosahoi, to ɓwasnu ge əsa nu n mi gnyilo n əfye aba m. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Əmi aɓyi ayeyeyi, aza n mi la je lodna n ɓyimanyasna, nya əsa n a ɓə lá Kirisiti je pwo dna n fye, <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />a wo mi lo ngye mi ye kwnugnyi lo n fyei nu nsaiye, maa əmi bəgye shnado, ntuge əfye əɓo wo mi lo!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haga n Saratui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Fye gna mi, əfye n fye ncei pma fya kwu fyi n owa snuta nyi, fye ta kpe əɓo ye lo n owa ncei da m? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ntuge a cei kakpe lo nge Ibrahim ɓə n anugwnui ngwnu-aba, gbmanyi nyikwoza fyenu nya, baayi, n nyikwo lalayi loloiya da. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Əwo nugwnu n nyikwoza fyenu yi, a ɓə ma wo vyi nayi ɓəzhni nu, ama əwo nugwnu n nyikwo loloiyai, a ɓə ma wo ntu zafnu ɓəgbeshi ɓo nu.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />A la aɓo ye kwu n zhni ɓədogbe nu: Anyikwo ye n zhni aɓəgbeshi ngwnu-aba nu. Ɓəgbeshi gbmanyi nu gbmi n Sinai Əpe, əkwo nu zhni Haga n wo ɓə ma aɓyi ɓa kwu zhni afyenu nyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Nsaiye, Haga nu zhni Sinai Əpe n kwo dna n Arabyiya əknyi nyi, n kwo gbedolo n Urishelima əzhiyaakwo nsaiye nya, ntuge wo dnalo n fyenu tnutnu n əwo aɓyii. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ama Urishelima n kwo tu n əshemi nyi, əkwoo da zhni loloiya nu jesnu əwo nu zhni əyi əya. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Ntuge a cei kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Dagbma, nyikwoza lama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">əho n ho too shni əɓyi ma nyi m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">ɓəwyi agbmada nya jesnu ha ɓəwyi n əgbei la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">əho n ho too shni lodna n əɓyima nyasna nyi m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">ntuge aɓyi nyikwoza ɓwawnayi nya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ɓa du əza nya lo n wo n ənui lo nyi.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Nsaiye, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye zhni aɓyi ɓəgbeshi nya nu ngye Ishakwu. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Dna nsayii, nugwnu n a ɓə ma wo dna n nayi nyi, wo ɓə kwu nugwnu n a ɓə ma wo dna n ikwo Zafnu nya nyi wu awyesnugbegye ɓo. Əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi nu zhni nsaiye. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ama knyiɓei nu n Nyakagyigyiyi ncei da lo a? “Gbmi nyikwoza fyenu nya ya n əwo nugwnui, ntuge nyikwoza fyenu nya nugwnu to ɓəi kwnu əgwúgyi n əɓyi nyikwoza loloiya nyai m nanyinanyi.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ntucenu, əmi azaje n amapwuyii, yi to zhni aɓyi nyikwoza fyenu nya nu m, ama nyikwoza lalayi loloiya nya.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Loloya dna n Kirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Ntu n gnyignyi ɓo nu n Kirisiti wo la yi loya. Nlonu, fye kwu myizhi, fye to ye ge a je fye dufyi n shnawo n korogbma fyenu nya m.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Fye kwu əmi aɓədagbma wnakna! Əmi Bwulus nu gna fye nge, ndei n fya ye ge a la fye znunya, Kirisiti taa shnasnu n apmai n əfye aba m, kpeekpe. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Njesnu mi gna zahozahoyi n wa fa əwohni tukwo aa wo znunya, kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ge, wa shi owa əɓwa vnyanya. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Əfye n fye zhi fyei ye ge fya ɓwa ɓəgyikpmaya n owai nyi, a la fye ceya n Kirisiti; jesnu fye la kwnuya n Shekwoyi shebmyashi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ntuge dna n Zafnu nu n yi fafazhi yii pmi n gaiciyagai, ɓəfyecezhni n yi n əwyei tu n kwo nyi. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ntuge dna n Kirisiti Yeisu, nyaznu kwo tnanyaznu, kwo to n apmai lo m. Əɓo kpokəloi ɓwashii əkwo nu zhni gaiciyaga ń kwo wu əkwohni dna n yeye nyi.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Fye ɓə zhni fyei znazna manai. Nyikanu n kwu aɓo gbmi fye aje woi zhni to fyei shna gaiciyanunui ɓwashi m ma a? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Aɓwatna ye pya kwo ta gbmi n əza aba nu n wa yì fye nyi m. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />“Yisti ɓyiyi zhni kwa gnamyi fyi n biledi mimii kwa zhni kwo kwaa snu vnyanya.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Mi n agwui myimyiilo dna n Dagayi nge fye taa zhni ɓənubwo n zokwo ədo m. Əza n wo gnyi woi dna fye n abaɓwi nyi, kwo woi zhni nyika nu a, wo ɓə gwo əkwo tata. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Əmi azaje n amapwuyii, ndei mi ɓə ye gnyi mii zhni waazi nyaznu nya nu, knyiyi nu zhni ai ye wu mi awyesnugbegye ɓo a? N kwa wu nlonu, akpəge a la znudu abwi gbmiya nu. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ama aza yi n ɓa lá gbuzui kala gnyi nyi, a wo mi lo ngye ɓa lo ɓəə kwu əɓahni nu wu əɓwa!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyìgyi dna n Zafnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Əfye, əmi azaje n amapwii, a ɓə yi fye fya ɓwa loloya nu. Ama fye to zhniapma n əfye loloyai fya lofyi n anyìgyi nayi nya m; n əkwoɓwi, fye zhni tnutnu ga aje dna n tukwogba n yeyei. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ntuge owa vnyanya ɓwa nunu dna n ɓəgbetu gbmanyi ye ɓwashi nu, n kwo gna, “Ye n əho kwnuzhiyii ngye əhohni tukwo.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />N fya gyiaje n anyiknai jesnu, fyei sa aje ya, fye zhni pəceye, ntolonu m, fye ɓa wu aje aɓwa jesnu fya zhni əfyehni agbma.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ntulonu, mi gna fye, nge fye znazna fyi n Zafnu, nlonu fye taa nu nayi aɓəmwi m. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Ntuge nayi aɓəmwi ɓa gnyiapaapa n Zafnu nyai, jesnu Zafnu nya gnyiapaapa n nayi nyai. Ɓa zhi n gwnukpeaje nu, nabai n fye taa myi fya zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi n fye ncei pma m. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ama ngye Zafnu nu dna ho n zokwo, ho to dnalo n owa snuta m.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Nayi atnutnu ɓa wu ɓahni pəipəi: asisiɓozhni, anyaajegbmi, nayi shakpe, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />ashnagba, agwuzhenyigye, nuwnu, ajegna, shewo, minagyi, gnawohni bwugbaɓəye, anyàwu, gnayazhi n akwui, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />n bmyibmyi; nyasnii, adokwowyefna n adoi n ɓa ce nyi. Mi kwnù fye nu, ngye she mi ɓə shni fye kwnù nyi, nge aza yi n ɓa gyianyì n wu nlai, ɓa to ɓə lofyi n Shekwoyi əbemi m.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ama nyagyigyi Zafnu nya nu nyi; yeye, agbmada, bwugbafu, bwugbaɓwa, ɓwaloya, ɓəmanaizhni, ɓəgbenuzhni, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ɓəzhni pəceye n tukwownai. Owa to lo ntu n aɓo ye pya aɓo m! <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Aza yi n ɓa zhni Kirisiti Yeisu anya, ɓa kwu əɓa nayi znudu ɓədo n əkwo aɓəpwawoi n əkwo aɓəmwii. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Shikwonyi yi gyianyì n Zafnu akalái nu, fa ya vyi Zafnu ɓəwu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Yi to kwu zè atukwomwayi, kwo ya fyi aje minagyi, kwo ya woshe n ajei m.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Aɓəmanai zhnizhni ga aza vnyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Əmi azaje n amapwuyii, ndei ń a wna əzaho dna n leifyi, əfye n fye gyianyì fyi n Zafnu nyi, fye jezeɓe n əza yii n atnazhnii. Ama fye zhni pəceye n əfyehni, ntolonu m, əfyehni ce fya ɓwa mwumwu. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Fye bma aje akaya ashnawoi shi, əkwo nu ɓa zhni fya nu Kirisiti owa. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ngye əzaho zhninubwo lo nge wo zhni nyaho nu to woi kwu nyaho nu zhni m, wo dna əwohni nu kwoce. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Zahozahoyi wo mwi əwohni, wa gye shi wo zhni aɓo ń wu. Nlonu n wo ɓa nya agbmada n əwohni ɓo, toge woi mwi əwohni ədo n zadoi m. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ntuge zahozahoyi ɓa la əwohni akaya nu. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Dudulonu əza n a wu wo Shekwoyi ɓədagbma, kwo bmyalo wa gná əwo anya amanai vnyanya n əzai n wo wu wo Shekwoyi ɓəda nyi.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Fye to dna fyehni kwoce ho m: A ta kpe Shekwoyi agyè m. Ənya n əza bye əkwo nu n wo ɓa do. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Zahozahoyi ń wa bye ənya ntuge kwa da əwo nayi, dna ń nayi wo ɓə do nyabwodo; zahozahoyi ń wa bye ənya n kwo dá Zafnu, dna n Zafnu n wo ɓə do wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />A to kwu yi ɓe n ɓəmanai zhnii m, ntuge əsa tutui ɓe lo yii gwo gyiba, ndei n yi to bmabwugba ya kwu fa zhni ɓo m. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ntucenu, əsa ń yi ɓwa aba ncei, fa ya zhni ɓəmanai ga aza vnyanya, Nshnisnusnu aza yi n ɓa fyi n avyiyi apwuwa nyi.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaznu ɓo nu to m ama wyewyeyi woiwoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Gye apaka ayaakwo pya n mi ka ga fye n əmihni aɓwai!<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Aza yi n ɓa ncei pma əɓa ɓo kwa da aza ń nayi ɓəzhnii, əɓa nu yi əɓahni nabai ɓa yekwofyi fye nge fye znunya. Ɓətukwo gbmanyi n kwo zhni ɓai zhni lonu, əkwo nu nge ɓa bwusi n awyesnugbegye wu ntu Kirisiti znudu ɓo. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kwo aza yi n ɓa n anyaznuznui lo nyi, ɓa ta shi owa əɓwa lo m; dudulonu ɓa ncei pma fya znunya, nabai n ɓa ɓá gyigbe ntu əfye anyaznu ɓo dna n nayi. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Mi ta ye lo ma gyigbe m nanyinanyi, akpəge dna n znudu əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya, ntu əkwo ɓo nu n a la anyì znudu n əmi aba n kasnu a lá mi znudu n anyì aba. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Nyaznu, kwo tnanyaznu to zhni nyaho nu m; ənya n kwo zhni ɓəkpokəloi əkwo nu zhni shnazhni woiwoyi. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Bwugbafu n snusnugyei ɓa lo aza aba vnyanya n ɓa shi ɓəgbetu ye ɓwa; kwa lo da Israila Shekwoyi nya.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo n abyei, zahozahoyi to je mi azhnì tu m, ntuge mi ń Yeisu Kirisiti acigwusai kpəlo n əmi nayi.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Shebmyashi əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya kwo kwnusnu n əfye zafnui, əmi azaje n amapwuyii. Amyi.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>